Define global ptrs as array<ptr<u8>, 8>.
i is 0.
Loop:
    If i is at least 8, Break.
    ptrs[i] = syscall(9, 0, 4096, 3, 0x22, -1, 0) as u64 as ptr<u8>.
    Set ptrs[i][0] to (i + 1) as u8.
    i += 1.
total is 0.
i is 0.
Loop:
    If i is at least 8, Break.
    total += ptrs[i][0] as i64.
    i += 1.
Return total.
